[0.021, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b[29A\u001b[94ma2ui_core\u001b[m has \u001b[1mno dependency on Flutter\u001b[m and \u001b[1mno LLM/prompting logic\u001b[m. It is the shared foundation parameterized over \u001b[94mT\u001b[m\r\n  \u001b[94mextends ComponentApi\u001b[m:\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n  \u2022 \u001b[1mWire Protocol & Envelopes\u001b[m: \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk3a4ee68cf26e82c9;file:///Users/brett/.pub-cache/hosted/pub.dev/a2ui_core-0.5.0/lib/src/core/messages.dart\u0007AgentToRendererMessage\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 (\u001b[94mCreateSurfaceMessage\u001b[m, \u001b[94mUpdateComponentsMessage\u001b[m,\r\n  \u001b[94mUpdateDataModelMessage\u001b[m, \u001b[94mDeleteSurfaceMessage\u001b[m, \u001b[94mCallRendererFunctionMessage\u001b[m) and \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk3a4ee58cf26e8116;file:///Users/brett/.pub-cache/hosted/pub.dev/a2ui_core-0.5.0/lib/src/core/messages.dart\u0007RendererToAgentMessage\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007\r\n  (\u001b[94mActionMessage\u001b[m, \u001b[94mErrorMessage\u001b[m, \u001b[94mFunctionResponseMessage\u001b[m).\u001b[K\r\n  \u2022 \u001b[1mCatalog Specification\u001b[m: \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkee8ab36dc2081926;file:///Users/brett/.pub-cache/hosted/pub.dev/a2ui_core-0.5.0/lib/src/core/catalog.dart\u0007Catalog<T extends ComponentApi, F extends FunctionApi>\u001b[m\u001b]8;;"]
[0.0, "o", "\u0007 and \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk2ba53b95a1339d5;file:///Users/brett/.pub-cache/hosted/pub.dev/a2ui_core-0.5.0/lib/src/basic_catalog/basic_catalog.dart\u0007BasicCatalog.v1_0\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 (JSON Schemas\r\n  for components and executable client-side functions like \u001b[94mformatString\u001b[m, \u001b[94mrequired\u001b[m, \u001b[94mregex\u001b[m).\u001b[K\r\n  \u2022 \u001b[1mMessage Routing & Validation\u001b[m: \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkd365fbab8fbb408f;file:///Users/brett/.pub-cache/hosted/pub.dev/a2ui_core-0.5.0/lib/src/processing/processor.dart#L98\u0007MessageProcessor<T>\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 consumes \u001b[94mAgentToRendererMessage\u001b[ms, validates them against\r\n  catalog schemas (\u001b[94mPayloadValidator\u001b[m) and component graph topology (\u001b[94mValidationConfig\u001b[m), and applies them to\u001b[K\r\n  \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk90a437fedff517e2;file:///Users/brett/.pub-cache/hosted/pub.dev/a2ui_core-0.5.0/lib/src/core/surface_group_model.dart#L22\u0007SurfaceGroupModel<T>\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007.\u001b[K\r\n  \u2022 \u001b[1mReactive Surface & Node Resolution\u001b[m: \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jka9798f4cdc4c5492;file:///Users/brett/.pub-cache/hosted/pub.dev/a2ui_core-0.5.0/lib/src"]
[0.0, "o", "/core/surface_model.dart#L188\u0007SurfaceModel<T>\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007, \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk9a9aecadf7890f52;file:///Users/brett/.pub-cache/hosted/pub.dev/a2ui_core-0.5.0/lib/src/core/data_model.dart\u0007DataModel\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007, \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkcf66789562aab98;file:///Users/brett/.pub-cache/hosted/pub.dev/a2ui_core-0.5.0/lib/src/resolution/generic_binder.dart#L84\u0007GenericBinder\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007, and \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkc7e19d48d92e3ca9;file:///Users/brett/.pub-cache/hosted/pub.dev/a2ui_core-0.5.0/lib/src/resolution/node_resolver.dart#L117\u0007NodeResolver<T>\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 turn a\r\n  surface's flat component map and JSON Pointer data model (\u001b[94m@path\u001b[m, \u001b[94m@call\u001b[m) into a reactive tree of \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk126da9719323d86d;file:///Users/brett/.pub-cache/hosted/pub.dev/a2ui_core-0.5.0/lib/src/resolution/component_node.dart\u0007ComponentNode<T>\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007\r\n  backed by \u001b[94mpreact_signals\u001b[m.\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n  \u001b[1m### \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk73a1241e93ff4a29;file:///Users/brett/.pub-cache/hosted/pub.dev/a2ui_agent-0.1.0/lib/a2ui_agent.dart\u0007a\u001b[22m2ui_agent\u001b[39;24;1m\u001b]8;;\u0007 \u2014 Agent C"]
[0.0, "o", "apability Negotiation, Prompt Generation & LLM Output Parsing (Pure Dart)\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[K\n  \u001b[94ma2ui_agent\u001b[m depends only on \u001b[94ma2ui_core\u001b[m (and \u001b[94mantlr4\u001b[m for Express syntax). It bridges \u001b[1man LLM/agent\u001b[m to \u001b[94ma2ui_core\u001b[m:\r\n\u001b[K\n  \u2022 \u001b[1mCapability Negotiation\u001b[m: \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkae6a8d925442de92;file:///Users/brett/.pub-cache/hosted/pub.dev/a2ui_agent-0.1.0/lib/src/processor/generator.dart\u0007A2uiGenerator\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 matches the client's \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk9b537174ee19f0d1;file:///Users/brett/.pub-cache/hosted/pub.dev/a2ui_core-0.5.0/lib/src/core/renderer_capabilities.dart\u0007A2uiRendererCapabilities\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 against available\r\n  \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk8cb24c227d1891f1;file:///Users/brett/.pub-cache/hosted/pub.dev/a2ui_agent-0.1.0/lib/src/processor/catalog_config.dart\u0007CatalogConfig\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007s (optionally pruning components/functions via \u001b[94mPruningTransformer\u001b[m) to create a per-turn\u001b[K\r\n  \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkbf06ca19ea821ace;file:///Users/brett/.pub-cache/hosted/pub.dev/a2ui_agent-0.1.0/lib/src/processor/processor.dart\u0007A"]
