[0.0, "o", "8;;\u001b\\ split raw LLM text\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[?5W\u001b[J  streams into prose \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk3e9f588585cea2aa;file:///Users/brett/.pub-cache/hosted/pub.dev/a2ui_agent-0.1.0/lib/src/parser/response_part.dart\u0007TextPart\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007, healed incremental \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk3e9f578585cea0f7;file:///Users/brett/.pub-cache/hosted/pub.dev/a2ui_agent-0.1.0/lib/src/parser/response_part.dart\u0007A2uiPart\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 (\u001b[94mList<AgentToRendererMessage>\u001b[m), and \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk3e9f568585ce9f44;file:///Users/brett/.pub-cache/hosted/pub.dev/a2ui_agent-0.1.0/lib/src/parser/response_part.dart\u0007ErrorPart\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 while\r\n  validating against \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk36fa72b777d72101;file:///Users/brett/.pub-cache/hosted/pub.dev/a2ui_agent-0.1.0/lib/src/utils/renderer_state.dart#L94\u0007RendererState\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 with transactional rollback on invalid blocks.\r\n\n  \u001b[1m### \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk247f2a59db060871;file:///Users/brett/.pub-cache/hosted/pub.dev/a2ui_flutter-0.1.0/lib/a2ui_flutter.dart\u0007a\u001b[22m2ui_flutter\u001b[39;24;1m\u001b]8;;\u0007 \u2014 Flutter Widget Adapter (\u001b[94mpackage:flutter\u001b[39m)\u001b[m\r\n"]
[0.0, "o", "\n  \u001b[94ma2ui_flutter\u001b[m depends on \u001b[94ma2ui_core\u001b[m and \u001b[94mflutter\u001b[m, with \u001b[1mno dependency on \u001b[94;22ma2ui_agent\u001b[m:\r\n\n  \u2022 \u001b[1mConcrete Component Type\u001b[m: Subclasses \u001b[94ma2ui_core\u001b[m's \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk62b3814b6c97404f;file:///Users/brett/.pub-cache/hosted/pub.dev/a2ui_core-0.5.0/lib/src/core/catalog.dart\u0007ComponentApi\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 into \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk1dd8c49563b2dd24;file:///Users/brett/.pub-cache/hosted/pub.dev/a2ui_flutter-0.1.0/lib/src/component_implementation.dart#L50\u0007ComponentImplementation\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007, which attaches a\r\n  \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkfca687b4ddc738f1;file:///Users/brett/.pub-cache/hosted/pub.dev/a2ui_flutter-0.1.0/lib/src/component_implementation.dart#L29\u0007ComponentWidgetBuilder\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 (\u001b[94mWidget Function(BuildContext, ComponentNode<ComponentImplementation>, ComponentProps,\u001b[m\r\n  \u001b[94mChildWidgetBuilder)\u001b[m) to each component's JSON Schema.\r\n  \u2022 \u001b[1mFlutter Basic Catalog\u001b[m: \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk3f1247360f0f6f0b;file:///Users/brett/.pub-cache/hosted/pub.dev/a2ui_flutter-0.1.0/lib/src/catalog/basic"]
[0.0, "o", "/basic_catalog.dart#L43\u0007basicCatalog()\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 returns a \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkad0cd97e34645239;file:///Users/brett/.pub-cache/hosted/pub.dev/a2ui_flutter-0.1.0/lib/src/component_implementation.dart#L64\u0007CatalogImplementation\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 (\u001b[94mCatalog<ComponentImplementation,\u001b[m\r\n  \u001b[94mFunctionImplementation>\u001b[m) implementing all 18 A2UI v1.0 basic components (\u001b[94mCard\u001b[m, \u001b[94mRow\u001b[m, \u001b[94mColumn\u001b[m, \u001b[94mList\u001b[m, \u001b[94mTabs\u001b[m, \u001b[94mModal\u001b[m, \u001b[94mText\u001b[m,\r\n  \u001b[94mImage\u001b[m, \u001b[94mIcon\u001b[m, \u001b[94mVideo\u001b[m, \u001b[94mAudioPlayer\u001b[m, \u001b[94mDivider\u001b[m, \u001b[94mButton\u001b[m, \u001b[94mTextField\u001b[m, \u001b[94mCheckBox\u001b[m, \u001b[94mChoicePicker\u001b[m, \u001b[94mSlider\u001b[m, \u001b[94mDateTimeInput\u001b[m).\r\n  \u2022 \u001b[1mReactive Surface Widget\u001b[m: \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk9b0ba2857ae5f16f;file:///Users/brett/.pub-cache/hosted/pub.dev/a2ui_flutter-0.1.0/lib/src/a2ui_surface.dart#L35\u0007A2uiSurface\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 takes a \u001b[94mSurfaceModel<ComponentImplementation>\u001b[m, attaches a\r\n  \u001b[94mNodeResolver<ComponentImplementation>\u001b[m, and rebuilds only the affected widget subtrees as signals in the "]
[0.0, "o", "surface's\r\n  component/data models change.\r\n  \u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\r\n  \u001b[1m## 2. The Exact Seamlines Between the Packages\u001b[m\r\n\n  There are \u001b[1mfour key seamlines\u001b[m where these packages connect:\r\n\n  \u001b[1m### Seamline 1: \u001b[94mComponentApi\u001b[39m \u2194 \u001b[94mComponentImplementation\u001b[39m (\u001b[94ma2ui_core\u001b[39m \u2194 \u001b[94ma2ui_flutter\u001b[39m & \u001b[94ma2ui_agent\u001b[39m)\u001b[m\r\n\n  \u001b[94ma2ui_core\u001b[m is generic over \u001b[94mT extends ComponentApi\u001b[m.\r\n\n  \u2022 A backend-only agent uses \u001b[94mCatalogApi\u001b[m (\u001b[94mCatalog<ComponentApi, FunctionApi>\u001b[m), which only carries JSON Schemas\r\n  (\u001b[94mBasicCatalog.v1_\u001b[m\r\n\u28bf  \u001b[94mW\u001b[90morking...\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[90m\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[94m>\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[90m\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500"]
