[0.0, "o", " Function(BuildContext, ComponentNode<ComponentImplementation>, ComponentProps,\u001b[m\r\n  \u001b[94mChildWidgetBuilder)\u001b[m) to each component's JSON Schema.\r\n  \u2022 \u001b[1mFlutter Basic Catalog\u001b[m: \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkd861ed9337d717a0;file:///Users/brett/.pub-cache/hosted/pub.dev/a2ui_flutter-0.1.0/lib/src/catalog/basic/basic_catalog.dart#L43\u0007basicCatalog()\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 returns a \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk3514a4e344339b6c;file:///Users/brett/.pub-cache/hosted/pub.dev/a2ui_flutter-0.1.0/lib/src/component_implementation.dart#L64\u0007CatalogImplementation\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 (\u001b[94mCatalog<ComponentImplementation,\u001b[m\r\n  \u001b[94mFunctionImplementation>\u001b[m) implementing all 18 A2UI v1.0 basic components (\u001b[94mCard\u001b[m, \u001b[94mRow\u001b[m, \u001b[94mColumn\u001b[m, \u001b[94mList\u001b[m, \u001b[94mTabs\u001b[m, \u001b[94mModal\u001b[m, \u001b[94mText\u001b[m,\r\n  \u001b[94mImage\u001b[m, \u001b[94mIcon\u001b[m, \u001b[94mVideo\u001b[m, \u001b[94mAudioPlayer\u001b[m, \u001b[94mDivider\u001b[m, \u001b[94mButton\u001b[m, \u001b[94mTextField\u001b[m, \u001b[94mCheckBox\u001b[m, \u001b[94mChoicePicker\u001b[m, \u001b[94mSlider\u001b[m, \u001b[94mDateTimeInput\u001b[m).\r\n  \u2022 \u001b[1mReactive Surface Widget\u001b[m: \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk5f792f9285"]
[0.0, "o", "407426;file:///Users/brett/.pub-cache/hosted/pub.dev/a2ui_flutter-0.1.0/lib/src/a2ui_surface.dart#L35\u0007A2uiSurface\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 takes a \u001b[94mSurfaceModel<ComponentImplementation>\u001b[m, attaches a\r\n  \u001b[94mNodeResolver<ComponentImplementation>\u001b[m, and rebuilds only the affected widget subtrees as signals in the surface's\r\n  component/data models change.\r\n  \u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\r\n  \u001b[1m## 2. The Exact Seamlines Between the Packages\u001b[m\r\n\n  There are \u001b[1mfour key seamlines\u001b[m where these packages connect:\r\n\n  \u001b[1m### Seamline 1: \u001b[94mComponentApi\u001b[39m \u2194 \u001b[94mComponentImplementation\u001b[39m (\u001b[94ma2ui_core\u001b[39m \u2194 \u001b[94ma2ui_flutter\u001b[39m & \u001b[94ma2ui_agent\u001b[39m)\u001b[m\r\n\n  \u001b[94ma2ui_core\u001b[m is generic over \u001b[94mT extends ComponentApi\u001b[m.\r\n\n  \u2022 A backend-only agent uses \u001b[94mCatalogApi\u001b[m (\u001b[94mCatalog<ComponentApi, FunctionApi>\u001b[m), which only carries JSON Schemas\r\n  (\u001b[94mBasicCatalog.v1_0()\u001b[m).\r\n  \u2022 A Flutter app uses \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk3514a6e344339ed2;file:///Users/brett/.pub-cache/hosted/pub.dev/a2ui_flutter-0.1.0/lib/src/c"]
[0.0, "o", "omponent_implementation.dart#L64\u0007CatalogImplementation\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 (\u001b[94mCatalog<ComponentImplementation, FunctionImplementation>\u001b[m from\r\n  \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkd85e6f9337d40baf;file:///Users/brett/.pub-cache/hosted/pub.dev/a2ui_flutter-0.1.0/lib/src/catalog/basic/basic_catalog.dart#L43\u0007basicCatalog()\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007). Because \u001b[94mComponentImplementation extends ComponentApi\u001b[m, the \u001b[1mexact same\u001b[m \u001b[94mCatalogImplementation\u001b[m object\r\n  can be passed to both:\n\u001b[18D\u2022 \u001b[94ma2ui_agent\u001b[m's \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk6f9ee958fc6ac584;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/data/repositories/chat_repository.dart#L134\u0007CatalogConfig(a2uiCatalog)\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 (which reads the schema/instructions to prompt and validate the LLM),\r\n\u001b[6Cand\n\b\b\b\u2022 \u001b[94ma2ui_core\u001b[m's [\u001b[94mMessageProcessor<ComponentImplementation>(catalogs:\u001b[m\n\u001b[66D\u001b[94m[a2uiCatalog])\u001b[m](file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/u\r\n\n\u28f7  \u001b[94mWorki\u001b[90mng...\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[90m\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500"]
