[0.0, "o", "m is generic over \u001b[94mT extends ComponentApi\u001b[m.\r\n\n  \u2022 A backend-only agent uses \u001b[94mCatalogApi\u001b[m (\u001b[94mCatalog<ComponentApi, FunctionApi>\u001b[m), which only carries JSON Schemas\r\n  (\u001b[94mBasicCatalog.v1_0()\u001b[m).\r\n  \u2022 A Flutter app uses \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk9401ab5559ddb991;file:///Users/brett/.pub-cache/hosted/pub.dev/a2ui_flutter-0.1.0/lib/src/component_implementation.dart#L64\u0007CatalogImplementation\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 (\u001b[94mCatalog<ComponentImplementation, FunctionImplementation>\u001b[m from\r\n  \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jka7be6d8785de098a;file:///Users/brett/.pub-cache/hosted/pub.dev/a2ui_flutter-0.1.0/lib/src/catalog/basic/basic_catalog.dart#L43\u0007basicCatalog()\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007). Because \u001b[94mComponentImplementation extends ComponentApi\u001b[m, the \u001b[1mexact same\u001b[m \u001b[94mCatalogImplementation\u001b[m object\r\n  can be passed to both:\n\u001b[18D\u2022 \u001b[94ma2ui_agent\u001b[m's \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkf7c8fa87e3bb3b83;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/data/repositories/chat_repository.dart#L134\u0007CatalogConfig(a2uiCatalog)\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 (which reads the schema/instructions"]
