[0.017, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b[29AThere are \u001b[1mfour key seamlines\u001b[m where these packages connect:\r\n\u001b[K\n  \u001b[1m### Seamline 1: \u001b[94mComponentApi\u001b[39m \u2194 \u001b[94mComponentImplementation\u001b[39m (\u001b[94ma2ui_core\u001b[39m \u2194 \u001b[94ma2ui_flutter\u001b[39m & \u001b[94ma2ui_agent\u001b[39m)\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[K\n  \u001b[94ma2ui_core\u001b[m is generic over \u001b[94mT extends ComponentApi\u001b[m.\r\n\u001b[K\n  \u2022 A backend-only agent uses \u001b[94mCatalogApi\u001b[m (\u001b[94mCatalog<ComponentApi, FunctionApi>\u001b[m), which only carries JSON Schemas\r\n  (\u001b[94mBasicCatalog.v1_0()\u001b[m).\u001b[K\r\n  \u2022 A Flutter app uses \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk52f87d5e2cc29384;file:///Users/brett/.pub-cache/hosted/pub.dev/a2ui_flutter-0.1.0/lib/src/component_implementation.dart#L64\u0007CatalogImplementation\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 (\u001b[94mCatalog<ComponentImplementation, FunctionImplementation>\u001b[m from\r\n  \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk3748f31dd8f1b18d;file:///Users/brett/.pub-cache/hosted/pub.dev/a2ui_flutter-0.1.0/lib/src/catalog/basic/basic_catalog.dart#L43\u0007basicCatalog()\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007). Because \u001b[94mComponentImplementation extends ComponentApi\u001b[m, the \u001b[1mexact same\u001b[m \u001b[94mCatalogIm"]
[0.0, "o", "plementation\u001b[m object\r\n  can be passed to both:\u001b[K\r\n      \u2022 \u001b[94ma2ui_agent\u001b[m's \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk71cd05ad14e003be;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/data/repositories/chat_repository.dart#L134\u0007CatalogConfig(a2uiCatalog)\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 (which reads the schema/instructions to prompt and validate the LLM),\r\n\u001b[6Cand\u001b[K\n\b\b\b\u2022 \u001b[94ma2ui_core\u001b[m's \u001b[94;1m\u001b]8;id=jke6fe10c13fffcbdc;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/ui/features/chat/view_models/chat_view_model.dart#L125-L129\u0007MessageProcessor<ComponentImplementation>(catalogs: [a2uiCatalog])\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007\n\u001b[80D\u001b[4m\u001b]8;id=jke6fe10c13fffcbdc;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/ui/features/chat/view_models/chat_view_model.dart#L125-L129\u0007file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/ui/features/chat/view_models/chat_view_model.dart#L125-L129\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 (which\r\n\u001b[6C\u001b[94ma2ui_flutter\u001b[m reads \u001b[94m.builder\u001b[m from to build widgets).\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n\n  \u001b[1m### Seamline 2: \u001b[94mA2uiRequestProcessor\u001b[39m \u2194 \u001b[94mMessageProcessor<T>\u001b[39m (\u001b[94ma2ui_agent\u001b[39m \u2194 \u001b[94ma2ui_c"]
[0.0, "o", "ore\u001b[39m)\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[K\n  Notice the doc comment in \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk51f6dab74750f230;file:///Users/brett/.pub-cache/hosted/pub.dev/a2ui_core-0.5.0/lib/src/processing/processor.dart#L63-L65\u0007MessageProcessor\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007:\r\n\u001b[K\n  \u2502 \u001b[3mNot to be confused with the Agent SDK's \u001b[94;23mA2uiRequestProcessor\u001b[39;3m, which runs the other way: it parses model output\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[4C\u001b[3minto the payloads this consumes.\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n  \u2022 \u001b[94mA2uiRequestProcessor\u001b[39;1m (\u001b[94;22ma2ui_agent\u001b[39;1m)\u001b[m: Converts \u001b[1mraw LLM text chunks\u001b[m (\u001b[94mString\u001b[m containing Markdown + \u001b[94m<a2ui-json>...\u001b[m\r\n  \u001b[94m</a2ui-json>\u001b[m)\u001b[K\n\n\n\u001b[13D\u001b[?2026l"]
