[0.017, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\r\u001b[29A\u001b[K\r\n  Notice the doc comment in \u001b]8;id=jkc462535ed640724b;file:///Users/brett/.pub-cache/hosted/pub.dev/a2ui_core-0.5.0/lib/src/processing/processor.dart#L63-L65\u001b\\\u001b[4;34;4mM\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4me\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4ms\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4ms\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4ma\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mg\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4me\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mP\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mr\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mo\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mc\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4me\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4ms\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4ms\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mo\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mr\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u001b\\:\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[?5W\u001b[J\n  \u2502 \u001b[3mNot to be confused with the Agent SDK's \u001b[94;23mA2uiRequestProcessor\u001b[39;3m, which runs the other way: it parses model output\u001b[m\r\n  \u2502 \u001b[3minto the payloads this consumes.\u001b[m\r\n\n  \u2022 \u001b[94mA2uiRequestProcessor\u001b[39;1m (\u001b[94;22ma2ui_agent\u001b[39;1m)\u001b[m: Converts \u001b[1mraw LLM text chunks\u001b[m (\u001b[94mString\u001b[m containing Markdown + \u001b[94m<a2ui-json>...\u001b[m\r\n  \u001b[94m</a2ui-json>\u001b[m) \u2192 \u001b[94mList<AgentToRendererMessage>\u001b[m.\r\n  \u2022 \u001b[94mMessageProcessor<T>\u001b[39;1m (\u001b[94;22ma2ui_core\u001b[39;1m)\u001b[m: Consumes \u001b[94mList<AgentToRendererMessage>\u001b[m \u2192 mutates \u001b[94mSurfaceGroupModel<T>\u001b[m /\r\n  \u001b[94mSurfaceModel<T>\u001b[m.\r\n  \u2022"]
[0.0, "o", " \u001b[1mHow they connect\u001b[m:\n\u001b[15D\u2022 \u001b[1mRemote Agent / Client split (over HTTP/WebSockets/gRPC)\u001b[m: The server runs \u001b[94mA2uiRequestProcessor.\u001b[m\n\u001b[96D\u001b[94mopenContinuingStream()\u001b[m and serializes the resulting \u001b[94mAgentToRendererMessage\u001b[ms over the wire; the Flutter client\r\n\u001b[6Cfeeds those decoded JSON messages directly into \u001b[94mMessageProcessor<ComponentImplementation>.processMessages(...)\u001b[m.\r\n\u001b[6C\u2022 \u001b[1mIn-Process Agent + Renderer (like this app)\u001b[m: \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkaf67e34803b98580;file:///Users/brett/.pub-cache/hosted/pub.dev/a2ui_agent-0.1.0/lib/src/utils/renderer_state.dart#L123\u0007RendererState.of(renderer)\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 and\n\u001b[77D\u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk3198e72cb224bf94;file:///Users/brett/.pub-cache/hosted/pub.dev/a2ui_agent-0.1.0/lib/src/processor/streamed_answer.dart#L65\u0007StreamedAnswer<ComponentImplementation>\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 wrap the UI's \u001b[94mMessageProcessor<ComponentImplementation>\u001b[m directly so\r\n\u001b[6C\u001b[94mA2uiRequestProcessor\u001b[m validates and applies messages straight into the live renderer in a single pass, emi"]
